  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The given circuit in the question is a case of a balanced Wheatstone bridge. Therefore, the circuit can be simplified as given below.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/c774b239-1fe7-4894-807a-86abed4fef47-image.png\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 160px;\" /></p><p>The equivalent resistance for the given circuit will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>eq</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math></p><p>Therefore, the current supplied by the battery is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
